msgstr ""
"Privater Secret-Key für die serverseitige Verifizierung. Niemals öffentlich "
"teilen."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1332
msgid "Sell more than credits"
msgstr "Verkaufe mehr als nur Guthaben"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1333
msgid ""
"Pro adds pricing plans, coupons, credit packs, webhooks, and full "
"transaction history."
msgstr ""
"Pro fügt Preispläne, Gutscheine, Guthaben-Pakete, Webhooks und die "
"vollständige Transaktionshistorie hinzu."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1335
msgid "Flexible pricing plans (one-off + subscription)"
msgstr "Flexible Preispläne (einmalig + Abo)"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1336
msgid "Coupon codes with expiry and usage limits"
msgstr "Gutscheincodes mit Ablaufdatum und Nutzungslimits"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1337
msgid "WooCommerce, PMPro, MemberPress adapters"
msgstr "WooCommerce-, PMPro-, MemberPress-Adapter"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1338
msgid "Transaction log + refund tooling"
msgstr "Transaktionsprotokoll + Werkzeuge für Rückerstattungen"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1346
msgid "7 days"
msgstr "7 Tage"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1347
#: includes/workflow/class-notifications.php:63
msgid "30 days"
msgstr "30 Tage"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1348
msgid "90 days"
msgstr "90 Tage"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1349
msgid "365 days"
msgstr "365 Tage"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1350
msgid "Permanent (no expiration)"
msgstr "Dauerhaft (kein Ablauf)"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1371
msgid "Credit Costs"
msgstr "Guthabenkosten"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1372
msgid ""
"Credits charged for submitting listings and upgrading them to Featured. Set "
"any cost to 0 to make that action free."
msgstr ""
"Guthaben, das für die Einreichung von Einträgen und deren Upgrade auf "
"Hervorgehoben berechnet wird. Setze einen Preis auf 0, um die jeweilige "
"Aktion kostenlos zu machen."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1377
msgid "Listing submission cost"
msgstr "Kosten für die Eintragseinreichung"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1389
msgid ""
"Charged when submitting a standard listing without a paid plan. Set to 0 "
"for free submissions."
msgstr ""
"Wird berechnet, wenn ein Standardeintrag ohne kostenpflichtigen Plan "
"eingereicht wird. Setze den Wert auf 0 für kostenlose Einreichungen."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1393
msgid "Featured upgrade cost"
msgstr "Kosten für das Hervorgehoben-Upgrade"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1405
msgid ""
"Charged when a user upgrades an existing listing to Featured. Set to 0 to "
"make upgrades free."
msgstr ""
"Wird berechnet, wenn ein Nutzer einen bestehenden Eintrag auf Hervorgehoben "
"upgradet. Setze den Wert auf 0, um Upgrades kostenlos zu machen."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1409
msgid "Featured duration"
msgstr "Hervorgehoben-Dauer"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1424
msgid "Featured duration presets"
msgstr "Voreinstellungen für die Hervorgehoben-Dauer"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1427
msgid "Preset…"
msgstr "Voreinstellung…"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1434
msgid ""
"How long a listing stays featured after upgrade. Set to 0 for permanent (no "
"expiration)."
msgstr ""
"Wie lange ein Eintrag nach dem Upgrade hervorgehoben bleibt. Setze den Wert "
"auf 0 für dauerhaft (kein Ablauf)."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1445
msgid "Payment Webhook"
msgstr "Zahlungs-Webhook"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1446
msgid ""
"Endpoint your payment provider POSTs to when a customer completes a "
"purchase. Listora verifies the HMAC signature, credits the matching user, "
"and writes a transaction ledger row."
msgstr ""
"Endpunkt, an den dein Zahlungsanbieter per POST sendet, wenn ein Kunde "
"einen Kauf abschließt. Listora prüft die HMAC-Signatur, schreibt dem "
"passenden Nutzer Guthaben gut und erstellt einen Eintrag im "
"Transaktionsprotokoll."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1451
msgid "Low Balance Alert"
msgstr "Warnung bei niedrigem Guthaben"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1463
msgid ""
"Email the user when their credit balance drops below this amount. Set to 0 "
"to disable."
msgstr ""
"Sendet dem Nutzer eine E-Mail, wenn sein Guthaben unter diesen Betrag "
"fällt. Setze den Wert auf 0, um dies zu deaktivieren."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1468
msgid "Webhook URL"
msgstr "Webhook-URL"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1474
#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1488
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "Kopieren"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1477
msgid ""
"Paste this URL into your payment provider as the webhook destination. See "
"the integration guide below for per-provider setup steps."
msgstr ""
"Füge diese URL bei deinem Zahlungsanbieter als Webhook-Ziel ein. Die "
"anbieterspezifischen Einrichtungsschritte findest du unten im "
"Integrationsleitfaden."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1482
msgid "Webhook Secret"
msgstr "Webhook-Secret"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1491
msgid ""
"Shared secret used to verify incoming webhook requests. Keep this value "
"private."
msgstr ""
"Gemeinsames Secret zur Überprüfung eingehender Webhook-Anfragen. Halte "
"diesen Wert geheim."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1501
msgid "How to wire this up (Stripe, PayPal, WooCommerce, custom)"
msgstr "So richtest du das ein (Stripe, PayPal, WooCommerce, individuell)"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1504
msgid "Request contract"
msgstr "Anfragevertrag"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1505
msgid ""
"Your provider (or a small relay you control) sends a signed POST to the "
"Webhook URL above. Listora rejects anything missing the headers below."
msgstr ""
"Dein Anbieter (oder ein kleiner Relay-Dienst, den du kontrollierst) sendet "
"eine signierte POST-Anfrage an die obige Webhook-URL. Listora lehnt alles "
"ab, dem die unten aufgeführten Header fehlen."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1509
msgid "Header"
msgstr "Header"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1510
msgid "Value"
msgstr "Wert"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1515
msgid ""
"Unix seconds at time of request. Anything more than 5 minutes off the "
"server clock is rejected (replay defence)."
msgstr ""
"Unix-Sekunden zum Zeitpunkt der Anfrage. Alles, was mehr als 5 Minuten von "
"der Serverzeit abweicht, wird abgelehnt (Schutz vor Replay-Angriffen)."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1520
msgid "JSON body fields"
msgstr "JSON-Body-Felder"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1524
msgid "Field"
msgstr "Feld"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1525
msgid "Required"
msgstr "Erforderlich"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1526
#: includes/import-export/class-csv-importer.php:59
#: includes/import-export/class-hivepress-migrator.php:283
#: templates/blocks/listing-submission/step-basic.php:71
#: templates/blocks/user-dashboard/tab-listings.php:482
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Beschreibung"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1530
msgid "yes"
msgstr "ja"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1530
msgid "WordPress user the credits are added to (matched by email)."
msgstr ""
"WordPress-Benutzer, dem das Guthaben gutgeschrieben wird (per "
"E-Mail-Adresse zugeordnet)."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1531
msgid "or"
msgstr "oder"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1531
msgid "one of"
msgstr "eines von"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1531
msgid ""
"`credits` = exact number to add. `amount` = currency value (multiplied by "
"your Credit Rate setting). At least one must be > 0."
msgstr ""
"`credits` = genaue Anzahl, die hinzugefügt werden soll. `amount` = "
"Währungsbetrag (multipliziert mit deiner Credit-Rate-Einstellung). "
"Mindestens einer muss größer als 0 sein."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1532
#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1533
msgid "recommended"
msgstr "empfohlen"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1532
msgid "Provider transaction reference, stored on the ledger row for reconciliation."
msgstr ""
"Transaktionsreferenz des Anbieters, gespeichert in der Ledger-Zeile zum "
"Abgleich."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1533
msgid "or your own slug."
msgstr "oder dein eigener Slug."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1534
#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1535
#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1536
msgid "optional"
msgstr "optional"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1534
msgid ""
"If set, also assigns the matching Pricing Plan + applies its "
"featured/duration perks."
msgstr ""
"Falls festgelegt, wird zusätzlich der passende Pricing Plan zugewiesen und "
"dessen Featured-/Laufzeit-Vorteile werden angewendet."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1535
msgid "Defaults to `payment.completed`. Used in audit-log entries."
msgstr "Standardmäßig `payment.completed`. Wird in Audit-Log-Einträgen verwendet."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1536
msgid ""
"Unix seconds inside the payload (separate from the header). Lets you sign "
"payloads without sending the header — handy for providers that strip custom "
"headers."
msgstr ""
"Unix-Sekunden innerhalb des Payloads (getrennt vom Header). Damit kannst du "
"Payloads signieren, ohne den Header zu senden – praktisch für Anbieter, die "
"eigene Header entfernen."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1540
msgid "Stripe"
msgstr "Stripe"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1542
msgid "Stripe Dashboard → Developers → Webhooks → Add endpoint."
msgstr "Stripe-Dashboard → Developers → Webhooks → Add endpoint."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1543
msgid ""
"Paste the Webhook URL above; subscribe to event "
"`checkout.session.completed` (or `payment_intent.succeeded` if you use raw "
"PaymentIntents)."
msgstr ""
"Füge die Webhook-URL oben ein; abonniere das Event "
"`checkout.session.completed` (oder `payment_intent.succeeded`, wenn du rohe "
"PaymentIntents verwendest)."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1544
msgid ""
"Stripe signs with its own header (`Stripe-Signature`). Listora does NOT "
"read that header — you need a tiny relay (Cloudflare Worker, custom "
"mu-plugin, or Pipedream) that re-signs Stripe's payload as "
"`<timestamp>.<body>` with the Listora secret and POSTs here. A 20-line "
"example lives in `docs/integrations/stripe-relay.md`."
msgstr ""
"Stripe signiert mit einem eigenen Header (`Stripe-Signature`). Listora "
"liest diesen Header NICHT – du brauchst ein kleines Relay (Cloudflare "
"Worker, ein eigenes mu-plugin oder Pipedream), das Stripes Payload als "
"`<timestamp>.<body>` mit dem Listora-Secret neu signiert und hierher per "
"POST sendet. Ein 20-zeiliges Beispiel findest du in "
"`docs/integrations/stripe-relay.md`."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1545
msgid "In the relay, map Stripe fields → Listora fields:"
msgstr "Ordne im Relay die Stripe-Felder den Listora-Feldern zu:"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1548
msgid "PayPal"
msgstr "PayPal"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1550
msgid ""
"PayPal Developer Dashboard → My Apps & Credentials → your app → Webhooks → "
"Add webhook."
msgstr ""
"PayPal Developer Dashboard → My Apps & Credentials → deine App → Webhooks → "
"Add webhook."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1551
msgid ""
"Webhook URL = your relay endpoint (PayPal posts IPN-style notifications "
"that need translating to the Listora payload shape)."
msgstr ""
"Webhook-URL = dein Relay-Endpunkt (PayPal sendet IPN-artige "
"Benachrichtigungen, die in die Listora-Payload-Struktur übersetzt werden "
"müssen)."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1552
msgid ""
"Subscribe to `PAYMENT.CAPTURE.COMPLETED` (REST API) or use IPN with "
"`txn_type=web_accept` / `payment_status=Completed`."
msgstr ""
"Abonniere `PAYMENT.CAPTURE.COMPLETED` (REST API) oder verwende IPN mit "
"`txn_type=web_accept` / `payment_status=Completed`."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1553
msgid "Relay maps:"
msgstr "Relay ordnet zu:"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1556
msgid "WooCommerce (same site)"
msgstr "WooCommerce (gleiche Website)"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1558
msgid ""
"Easiest path: skip the webhook entirely. Install the matching credit "
"adapter under Listora → Settings → Credits → Credit Mappings; the SDK reads "
"WooCommerce order completion directly and tops up credits in-process."
msgstr ""
"Einfachster Weg: den Webhook komplett überspringen. Installiere den "
"passenden Credit-Adapter unter Listora → Settings → Credits → Credit "
"Mappings; das SDK liest den Abschluss einer WooCommerce-Bestellung direkt "
"aus und lädt Credits im laufenden Prozess auf."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1559
msgid ""
"Alternative (cross-site WC): wire WooCommerce → Settings → Advanced → "
"Webhooks → Add webhook. Topic `Order updated`. Delivery URL = the Listora "
"Webhook URL above. Add a small `woocommerce_webhook_payload` filter that "
"emits the Listora payload shape with the order's `billing_email`, `total`, "
"`id`, and `\"woocommerce\"`."
msgstr ""
"Alternative (websiteübergreifendes WC): richte WooCommerce → Settings → "
"Advanced → Webhooks → Add webhook ein. Topic `Order updated`. Delivery-URL "
"= die obige Listora-Webhook-URL. Füge einen kleinen "
"`woocommerce_webhook_payload`-Filter hinzu, der die "
"Listora-Payload-Struktur mit `billing_email`, `total`, `id` und "
"`\"woocommerce\"` der Bestellung ausgibt."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1562
msgid "Test it works (curl)"
msgstr "Testen, ob es funktioniert (curl)"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1563
msgid ""
"Run this from a terminal to confirm the endpoint accepts a signed request. "
"Replace `<SECRET>` with the Webhook Secret above."
msgstr ""
"Führe das im Terminal aus, um zu bestätigen, dass der Endpunkt eine "
"signierte Anfrage akzeptiert. Ersetze `<SECRET>` durch das obige "
"Webhook-Secret."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1572
msgid ""
"Expected response: HTTP 200 with "
"`{\"success\":true,\"credits_added\":10,...}`. Errors return a JSON body "
"with `code` and `message` — check the Audit Log (Listora → Audit Log) for "
"rejection reasons."
msgstr ""
"Erwartete Antwort: HTTP 200 mit "
"`{\"success\":true,\"credits_added\":10,...}`. Bei Fehlern wird ein "
"JSON-Body mit `code` und `message` zurückgegeben – im Audit Log (Listora → "
"Audit Log) findest du die Ablehnungsgründe."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1580
msgid "Related screens"
msgstr "Verwandte Bildschirme"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1581
msgid ""
"Quick access to credit-related data screens. Mappings now live on this same "
"tab below; these buttons jump to the rows-and-history surfaces."
msgstr ""
"Schnellzugriff auf Bildschirme mit Credit-bezogenen Daten. Mappings "
"befinden sich jetzt weiter unten auf diesem Tab; diese Schaltflächen "
"springen zu den Ansichten mit Zeilen und Verlauf."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1586
msgid "Transactions"
msgstr "Transaktionen"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1590
#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1595
msgid "View Transaction Log"
msgstr "Transaktionsprotokoll anzeigen"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1592
msgid "Per-user credit ledger with filters and CSV export."
msgstr "Credit-Ledger pro Benutzer mit Filtern und CSV-Export."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1597
msgid ""
"The transaction log requires WB Listora Pro with monetization enabled. It "
"appears here once monetization is turned on."
msgstr ""
"Das Transaktionsprotokoll erfordert WB Listora Pro mit aktivierter "
"Monetarisierung. Es erscheint hier, sobald die Monetarisierung aktiviert "
"ist."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1602
msgid "Pricing plans"
msgstr "Preispläne"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1606
#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1611
msgid "Manage Pricing Plans"
msgstr "Preispläne verwalten"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1608
msgid ""
"Bundle credits + listing limits into named plans assigned at submission "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Bündle Credits und Listing-Limits in benannten Plänen, die bei der "
"Einreichung zugewiesen werden."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1613
msgid ""
"Pricing plans require WB Listora Pro with monetization enabled. The plans "
"manager appears here once monetization is turned on."
msgstr ""
"Preispläne erfordern WB Listora Pro mit aktivierter Monetarisierung. Die "
"Planverwaltung erscheint hier, sobald die Monetarisierung aktiviert ist."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1655
msgid "Listing Limits per Role"
msgstr "Listing-Limits pro Rolle"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1656
msgid ""
"Configure how many listings each role can submit per period. Beyond the "
"limit, block the submission or allow overflow in exchange for credits."
msgstr ""
"Lege fest, wie viele Listings jede Rolle pro Zeitraum einreichen darf. Über "
"dem Limit kannst du die Einreichung blockieren oder gegen Credits einen "
"Überlauf zulassen."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1662
msgid "Limit period"
msgstr "Limit-Zeitraum"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1665
msgid "Limit Period"
msgstr "Limit-Zeitraum"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1669
msgid "Lifetime"
msgstr "Lebenszeit"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1670
msgid "count every listing a user has ever submitted."
msgstr "zählt jedes Listing, das ein Benutzer jemals eingereicht hat."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1674
msgid "Calendar month"
msgstr "Kalendermonat"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1675
msgid "resets on the 1st of each month."
msgstr "wird am 1. jedes Monats zurückgesetzt."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1679
msgid "Rolling 30 days"
msgstr "Gleitende 30 Tage"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1680
msgid "counts submissions in the last 30 days from today."
msgstr "zählt Einreichungen der letzten 30 Tage ab heute."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1688
msgid "Per-role limits"
msgstr "Limits pro Rolle"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1693
msgid "Role"
msgstr "Rolle"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1695
msgid "Listings per period"
msgstr "Listings pro Zeitraum"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1701
msgid "No roles registered."
msgstr "Keine Rollen registriert."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1743
#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1784
msgid "per period"
msgstr "pro Zeitraum"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1752
msgid ""
"Check \"Unlimited\" to remove the cap for a specific role. Otherwise, the "
"number applies per period."
msgstr ""
"Aktiviere „Unbegrenzt“, um die Obergrenze für eine bestimmte Rolle "
"aufzuheben. Andernfalls gilt die Zahl pro Zeitraum."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1758
msgid "Default limit"
msgstr "Standardlimit"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1785
msgid ""
"Applied to any role not listed above (e.g. roles added by other plugins). "
"Check Unlimited to remove the cap."
msgstr ""
"Gilt für jede oben nicht aufgeführte Rolle (z. B. von anderen Plugins "
"hinzugefügte Rollen). Aktiviere Unbegrenzt, um die Obergrenze aufzuheben."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1790
msgid "Beyond-limit behavior"
msgstr "Verhalten bei Überschreitung des Limits"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1793
msgid "Beyond Limit Behavior"
msgstr "Verhalten bei Überschreitung des Limits"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1804
msgid "Block submission"
msgstr "Einreichung blockieren"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1805
msgid "show \"You have reached your limit\" and stop the submission."
msgstr "zeigt „Du hast dein Limit erreicht“ an und stoppt die Einreichung."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1816
msgid "Allow with credit cost"
msgstr "Mit Credit-Kosten zulassen"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1817
msgid "user pays the credit cost below for each additional listing."
msgstr ""
"der Benutzer zahlt die unten angegebenen Credit-Kosten für jedes "
"zusätzliche Listing."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1826
msgid "Overflow cost"
msgstr "Überlaufkosten"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1838
msgid "credits per extra listing"
msgstr "Credits pro zusätzlichem Listing"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1839
msgid ""
"Charged when a user submits beyond their role limit. Set to 0 to disable "
"the overflow path (the limit becomes a hard stop)."
msgstr ""
"Wird berechnet, wenn ein Benutzer über sein Rollenlimit hinaus einreicht. "
"Auf 0 setzen, um den Überlaufpfad zu deaktivieren (das Limit wird dann zu "
"einer harten Grenze)."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1861
msgid ""
"Control how new reviews are approved, who can submit them, and their "
"minimum length."
msgstr ""
"Steuere, wie neue Reviews genehmigt werden, wer sie einreichen darf und "
"welche Mindestlänge sie haben müssen."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1871
msgid "Publish new reviews immediately (skip moderation queue)"
msgstr "Neue Reviews sofort veröffentlichen (Moderationswarteschlange überspringen)"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1873
msgid "When disabled, reviews stay in Pending until an admin approves them."
msgstr ""
"Wenn deaktiviert, bleiben Reviews auf „Ausstehend“, bis ein Administrator "
"sie genehmigt."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1885
msgid "Minimum length"
msgstr "Mindestlänge"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1888
msgid "characters"
msgstr "Zeichen"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1889
msgid ""
"Minimum characters required for the review body. Set to 0 to allow ratings "
"with no written feedback."
msgstr ""
"Mindestanzahl an Zeichen, die für den Review-Text erforderlich sind. Auf 0 "
"setzen, um Bewertungen ohne geschriebenes Feedback zuzulassen."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1893
msgid "One review per listing"
msgstr "Ein Review pro Listing"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1898
msgid "Limit each user to a single review per listing"
msgstr "Beschränke jeden Benutzer auf ein einziges Review pro Listing"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1900
msgid "Prevents rating inflation from repeat submissions by the same user."
msgstr ""
"Verhindert eine Bewertungsinflation durch wiederholte Einreichungen "
"desselben Benutzers."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1909
msgid "Owner Replies"
msgstr "Antworten des Eigentümers"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1910
msgid ""
"Whether listing owners can publicly respond to reviews left on their "
"listings."
msgstr ""
"Ob Listing-Eigentümer öffentlich auf Reviews antworten können, die zu ihren "
"Listings hinterlassen wurden."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1915
msgid "Enable replies"
msgstr "Antworten aktivieren"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1920
msgid "Allow listing owners to publicly reply to reviews"
msgstr "Erlaube Listing-Eigentümern, öffentlich auf Reviews zu antworten"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1922
msgid ""
"Replies appear beneath each review. Owners are notified by email when a "
"review is left on their listing."
msgstr ""
"Antworten erscheinen unterhalb jedes Reviews. Eigentümer werden per E-Mail "
"benachrichtigt, wenn ein Review zu ihrem Listing hinterlassen wird."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1941
msgid "Emails sent when listings are submitted, approved, rejected, or expire."
msgstr ""
"E-Mails, die gesendet werden, wenn Listings eingereicht, genehmigt, "
"abgelehnt werden oder ablaufen."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1955
msgid "Emails sent around review activity on listings."
msgstr ""
"E-Mails, die im Zusammenhang mit Review-Aktivitäten zu Listings gesendet "
"werden."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1959
msgid ""
"Sent to the reviewer when their review reaches a helpful-vote milestone (1, "
"5, 10, 25, 50, 100)."
msgstr ""
"Wird an den Rezensenten gesendet, wenn sein Review einen Meilenstein bei "
"hilfreichen Stimmen erreicht (1, 5, 10, 25, 50, 100)."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1960
#: includes/rest/class-unsubscribe-controller.php:271
msgid "Review reply reminder"
msgstr "Erinnerung für Review-Antwort"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1960
msgid "Nudge sent to listing owners with reviews still awaiting a reply."
msgstr ""
"Erinnerung an Listing-Eigentümer, deren Reviews noch auf eine Antwort "
"warten."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1965
msgid "Emails sent during the business claim workflow."
msgstr "E-Mails, die während des Claim-Workflows für Unternehmen gesendet werden."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1980
#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:2012
msgid "Send Test Email"
msgstr "Test-E-Mail senden"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1981
msgid ""
"Pick any notification event below and deliver a sample message to confirm "
"your email setup is working."
msgstr ""
"Wähle unten ein beliebiges Benachrichtigungsereignis aus und sende eine "
"Beispielnachricht, um zu bestätigen, dass deine E-Mail-Einrichtung "
"funktioniert."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1986
msgid "Email type"
msgstr "E-Mail-Typ"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:1997
msgid "Choose which template the test send should use."
msgstr "Wähle aus, welche Vorlage der Testversand verwenden soll."

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:2001 includes/class-assets.php:586
msgid "Recipient"
msgstr "Empfänger"

#: includes/admin/class-settings-page.php:2005
msgid "Defaults to your account email."
